        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The tyrannosaurus critically hits a foe with its foot</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature struck by the foot is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} and held in place. As long as the tyrannosaurus doesn't move from its position, the pinned creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}.</p><p>A tyrannosaurus gains a +2 circumstance bonus to attack a creature it has pinned in this manner.</p>"
